{"id":"npc:%E5%8E%A8%E5%AD%90","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"萨卡兹雇佣兵，泥岩与大鲍勃的旧相识，参与沃伦姆德暴动。在前往卡兹戴尔的途中带队在树林中前进时被沃伦姆德的高塔术师当做施术单元，导致源石结晶穿破皮肤，最终死亡。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情回首。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_053.png"}],"appearances":[]}